# Experiment 2 – Network Topology Creation (Star, Bus, Ring)

## Aim
To create and understand Star, Bus and Ring network topologies using Cisco Packet Tracer and verify communication between connected devices.

## Requirements
- Cisco Packet Tracer
- Minimum 3 PCs
- 1 switch for Star topology
- Copper Straight-Through cables

## 1. Star Topology

```text
       PC0
        |
PC1 -- Switch -- PC2
```

### IP Addressing

| Device | IP Address | Subnet Mask |
|---|---|---|
| PC0 | 192.168.1.1 | 255.255.255.0 |
| PC1 | 192.168.1.2 | 255.255.255.0 |
| PC2 | 192.168.1.3 | 255.255.255.0 |

### Procedure
1. Add one Cisco 2960 switch and three PCs.
2. Connect each PC to the switch using Copper Straight-Through cables.
3. Assign the IP addresses shown above.
4. From PC0, run `ping 192.168.1.2` and `ping 192.168.1.3`.

## 2. Bus Topology

Packet Tracer does not provide a true Bus topology using a single shared cable. The record describes simulating it by connecting PCs through a hub or switch.

```text
        PC0
         |
      Hub/Switch
       /     \\
     PC1     PC2
```

### IP Addressing

| Device | IP Address |
|---|---|
| PC0 | 192.168.2.1 |
| PC1 | 192.168.2.2 |
| PC2 | 192.168.2.3 |

Subnet Mask: `255.255.255.0`

### Procedure
1. Add three PCs and a Hub/Switch.
2. Connect the PCs to the Hub/Switch.
3. Assign the IP addresses above.
4. Test using `ping 192.168.2.2` and `ping 192.168.2.3`.

## 3. Ring Topology

The record notes that Packet Tracer does not support a physical Ring topology for Ethernet LANs. It can be represented conceptually by connecting three switches in a loop and attaching a PC to each switch.

```text
       Switch0
       /     \\
  Switch1 --- Switch2
    |           |
   PCs attached to the switches
```

### Procedure
1. Add three switches and connect them in a loop.
2. Attach one PC to each switch.
3. Assign IP addresses in the same subnet.
4. Verify connectivity using Ping.

## Result
Star, Bus (simulated) and Ring (conceptual/simulated) topologies were studied and created in Cisco Packet Tracer. IP addresses were assigned and connectivity was verified using Ping.
